{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）下午1時23分，警方接報，北大嶼山公路近東涌東交匯處有泥頭車失事，疑「自炒」撞鐵欄後冒煙。網上圖片可見，現場落大雨，涉事泥頭車的右後胎飛脫，碎片散落一地。人員到場，發現泥頭車漏油，正在場處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事泥頭車的右後車輪飛脫，碎片散落一地。（車cam L（香港群組）圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200446936285450240356042.jpeg/14DK2xWBhDdTOFI0RcExsd-wxjOA3dQk_6ADvf-gA70\"/><figcaption>涉事泥頭車的右後車輪飛脫，碎片散落一地。（車cam L（香港群組）圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.232889+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:05:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T17:38:02.482475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:25.593902+00:00","content_hash":"89706ee8bb68e8c7e633a85576912a44e7d8ee202e1028adfdec22c1a4cc1e51","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}